# ── Generated analysis artifacts ──
# Blanket-exclude charts and CSVs produced by running the scripts, then
# whitelist the specific files the README/portfolio depends on. Order
# matters: the `!` exceptions must come AFTER the `*.png` / `*.csv` rules.
*.png
*.csv
!week1/nifty_comparison.csv
!docs/screenshots/*.png
!docs/results/*.csv

